 {:entry/name        "Eärendil"
  :entry/type        :entry.type/character
  :entry/description "Son of _Tuor_ and _Idril_ _Turgon_’s daughter; escaped from the sack of _Gondolin_ and wedded _Elwing_ daughter of _Dior_ at the Mouths of _Sirion_; sailed with her to _Aman_ and pleaded for help against _Morgoth_; set to sail the skies in his ship _Vingilot_ bearing the _Silmaril_ that _Beren_ and _Lúthien_ brought out of _Angband_. The name means Lover of _The Sea_."
